muser-mode
Target Mask(USER_MODE)
Generate code for user mode, where $mr0-$mr2 are available as registers.

mlayout=
Target RejectNegative Joined Enum(tdm_layout) Var(tdm_layout) Init(0)
Link for this memory layout: shared (code and data together below word 0x8000, the default) or largemem (data below 0x8000, code above it).

Enum
Name(tdm_layout) Type(int)
Memory layouts for -mlayout=:

EnumValue
Enum(tdm_layout) String(shared) Value(0)

EnumValue
Enum(tdm_layout) String(largemem) Value(1)
